                                                "sense_id": "fe251ea5-7837-3cc7-8c6b-4544be4a5483",
                                                "text": "Half of the comedy in West’s self-deprecating appearance on “Mr. Plow” comes from the veteran actor’s purring, self-satisfied delivery as he tells a deeply unnerved Bart and Lisa of the newfangled, less groovy cinematic Batman"
